# hit box (walk-behind); facings: e/w are one drawing mirrored (free), n/s are separate drawings.
# role: edge (barrier that lines a border or blocks a side way), backdrop (giant, partly off the map),
# landmark (one per map, the path leads to it), noise (small, dead space).
# place: (area, zones in order of preference, count, shown, name)
# zones: n e s w (touch that map edge), edge (any blocked cells next to open ground), water (all ~),
# shore (on ~ and blocked land, touching the bank).
